  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.4.0.0 (2026-11-24): Adds support for Net11.0, updates NuGet packages, adds overloads of `WriteTo.PostgreSQL` and `AuditTo.PostgreSQL` that take an `NpgsqlDataSource`, for example to rotate passwords (https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/86, https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/68), adds `EventTypeColumnWriter` (https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/77), adds the option to write the timestamp of `LogEventSerializedColumnWriter` in UTC (https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/67), adds the options to leave properties out of the `Properties` and `LogEvent` columns (https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/8), fixes `needAutoCreateTable` and `needAutoCreateSchema` failing for users that may not create a table or schema although it already exists (https://github.com/serilog-contrib/Serilog.Sinks.Postgresql.Alternative/issues/93).",
